1715:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Canxl/Std/IfxCanxl.h ****  * \param shortPhase PWM phase Short (PWMS). Valid values are 0x0 to 0x3F (5 bits).
1716:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Canxl/Std/IfxCanxl.h ****  * The actual interpretation of this value is that the PWM short phase length is (PWMS + 1) clock c
1717:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Canxl/Std/IfxCanxl.h ****  * \param longPhase PWM phase Long (PWML). Valid values are 0x0 to 0x3F (5 bits).
1718:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Canxl/Std/IfxCanxl.h ****  * The actual interpretation of this value is that the PWM long phase length is (PWML + 1) clock cy
1719:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Canxl/Std/IfxCanxl.h ****  * \param offset PWM Offset (PWMO). Valid values are 0x0 to 0x3F (5 bits).
1720:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Canxl/Std/IfxCanxl.h ****  * PWMO shall always be smaller than the PWM symbol length (PWMO < PWMS + PWML + 2)
1721:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Canxl/Std/IfxCanxl.h ****  * \return TRUE: Correct configuration was provided and the register was modified.
1722:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Canxl/Std/IfxCanxl.h ****  * FALSE: Incorrect configuration was provided and register was NOT modified.
1723:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Canxl/Std/IfxCanxl.h ****  */
